{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“隼太……”", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 305, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "ht0647", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这次，隼太只是沉默地拍拍我的肩。", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是期末考试最后一天。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "连日来与美羽学姐的“读书会”也结束了。", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，我不能就此停滞不前。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不要怨叹过去，要注视前方。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跟至今为止不像话的自己说再见。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "沉浸在考试结束后的轻松感中，我走向社团教室。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后在外面的饮水处看见美羽学姐的身影。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜噜。”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "pn0380", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔呼呼，好冷好冷喔～♪”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 316, "voice": "mu1638", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐带着和平常一样的笑容正在帮熊喵洗脚。", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯咻。好了，用毛巾把脚脚擦干喔～”", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 316, "voice": "mu1639", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜～♪”", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "pn0381", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "熊喵只要脚弄脏了，就一定会去找人来帮它洗。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为不洗干净的话它就不能趴在学姐的头上。所以至今为止它从来没有弄脏过我们的衣服。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“熊喵，洗干净太好了呢～”", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 305, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呜噜～”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "pn0382", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，新吾君辛苦了。考试顺利结束了？”", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 316, "voice": "mu1640", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“请不要问我结果。”", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 305, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔～是我害的吧。”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 316, "voice": "mu1641", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不，只是我的意志太薄弱而已。”", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 305, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结果，考试期间我去学姐房间都不是在念书。", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天开始必须稍微自重点才行。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……新吾君，今天也要来我家吗？”", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 316, "voice": "mu1642", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "嗯，自重是不可能的了。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果不会给你添麻烦的话。”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 305, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，那放学就一起回去吧♪”", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 316, "voice": "mu1643", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明这些天来都让学姐看到我丢脸的样子，但她的态度一点也没有变。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我必须尽快回应她的这份温柔才行啊，身为一个男人……", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜……”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "pn0383", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……也差不多该帮小熊喵洗澡了呢～”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 316, "voice": "mu1644", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜噜！”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "pn0384", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“学姐都在家帮它洗澡吗？”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 305, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，没错喔～因为小熊喵很爱干净，所以最喜欢洗澡了，对吧？”", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 316, "voice": "mu1645", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜～♪”", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "pn0385", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过即使如此，美羽学姐还是没有把熊喵养在家里。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐还是忘不了小时候养的那只因病死掉的猫吧。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "熊喵应该也是想和美羽学姐一起生活的……", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……新吾君也要跟小熊喵一起洗澡吗？”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 316, "voice": "mu1646", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不，那有点……”", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 305, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我知道自己一定会对学姐出手。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔呼呼，我好像也想跟新吾君两个人一起洗呢♪”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 316, "voice": "mu1647", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在进浴室前，我想先进入学姐的体内！", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "认真这样想的我，已经再也离不开学姐了吧……", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么了，纱凪？好不容易考试结束了，你待在这种地方……”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "ar4416", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……没怎样啊。”", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sn1408", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“该不会还放不下那个人？”", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "ar4417", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你很烦欸，爱理。”", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sn1409", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我是担心纱凪……”", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "ar4418", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我知道。我很感谢爱理。”", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sn1410", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "ar4419", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊～啊，去把手机号码解约好了。”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sn1411", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为什么？手机办了就办了，很方便不是吗？”", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "ar4420", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是没错啦。”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sn1412", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你也常常跟天羽学姐通邮件不是吗？”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "ar4421", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sn1413", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“有烦恼的话就说出来，我陪你聊聊。”", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "ar4422", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“与其说烦恼，应该是自我厌恶……”", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sn1414", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“自我厌恶？”", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "ar4423", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“自从告诉新吾手机号码后……我就一直在期待手机响起。”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sn1415", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“期待会不会是那家伙打来或发来的邮件。”", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sn1416", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "ar4424", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“到了半夜，偶尔还会想听听那家伙的声音。到底为什么呢……”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sn1417", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唉……你什么时候变成那种女孩子了啊？”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "ar4425", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我自己也不知道。但是，改变了我的是那家伙。虽然不想承认。”", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sn1418", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“女人真不应该谈恋爱呢。”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "ar4426", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……虽然会是很好的经验。”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sn1419", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哼嗯～那就趁这机会成为恋爱达人试试看吧？”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 312, "voice": "ar4427", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那不可能。”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sn1420", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为，已经结束了啊。我最初也是最后的恋爱──”", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sn1421", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、啊、学姐、等……”", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 305, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊啊──！？”", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 305, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 316, "voice": "mu1648", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……啊……美羽……学姐……”", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 305, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“射了好多出来……好厉害呢……”", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 316, "voice": "mu1649", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈啊、哈啊……哈啊……哈啊……”", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 305, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天的挑战结束了。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天又被学姐榨得一干二净。", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身体好沉重。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只要闭上眼，好像就会直接睡得像一摊泥。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾君，你的眼神好迷蒙……很舒服吗？”", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 316, "voice": "mu1650", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 305, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当我还在放空的时候，学姐吻了我。", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯、啾、啊姆、啾、咧溜、咧噜、嗯嗯、啾、啾、嗯嗯……”", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 316, "voice": "mu1651", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她一边纠缠我的舌头，一边套弄我的家伙，整根都被精液抹得湿黏。", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……再多努力一下吧？”", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 316, "voice": "mu1652", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、啊、啊……”", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 305, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐加快节奏套弄，我忍耐不住地发出呻吟。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐沾满精液的手挑逗着我，几乎要把我玩坏。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾君可爱的表情，还想再看更多……”", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 316, "voice": "mu1653", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊、啊啊啊啊！？”", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 305, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……解脱的方法，我还毫无所知。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
